# Rosalyn (Kaperosa) - 6-Chapter Interactive Deduction Arc (Triangle B - Character #1)
# Voice: Painfully shy, hushed 1-to-7 word fragments. Never chatty; the player nudges & deduces!
# Mechanic: Intangible (is_visit_only) Ch. 1-5; gated by Brahim & Danilo prerequisites; Ch. 6 First Purchase!
# Rules: 100% spoken voice. Counter, not grille. Zero [pause]/[wave] spam. Zero time-of-day/weekday words.

label Greeting
if {Transaction_HasReactiveOpener}:
	Rosalyn: {Transaction_ReactiveOpener}

if {Transaction_Chapter} == 0.0:
	# Chapter 1: "Under the Bulb" (is_visit_only | 0 tallies - Pure silent first contact)
	Rosalyn: ...
	- Hi there. Need something?
	- Take your time, miss.
	- [Wait quietly and nod.]
	Rosalyn: ...
	- Looking for something cold?
	- Warm light's free. No rush.
	Rosalyn: ...
	[signal arg="flag:rosalyn_seen=true"]
	[signal arg="note:A pale floating girl in a tattered white dress with messy long hair stood silently in the light, staring at my face before slipping away."]
	[signal arg="story_success"]
	[end_timeline]

elif {Transaction_Chapter} == 1.0:
	# Chapter 2: "Under the Floorboards" (is_visit_only | Player nudges & deduces why she can't pay | +1 / 0 / -1)
	Rosalyn: ...
	- You came back.
	- Take your time, miss.
	Rosalyn: Hello, po.
	- Looking to buy something?
	- Just visiting the light?
	Rosalyn: Brought coins.
	Rosalyn: Oh.
	Rosalyn: ...
	- Did you forget your purse?
		Rosalyn: Held them tight, po.
		Rosalyn: Under your floorboards now.
	- Did they drop on the floor?
		Rosalyn: Not on it, po.
		Rosalyn: Straight through the wood.
	- Changed your mind?
		Rosalyn: Tried paying, po.
		Rosalyn: Fell straight through my palm.
	Rosalyn: Sorry. Can't pick them up.
	Rosalyn: Should go.
	- Stay anyway. Light's free.
		[signal arg="flag:rosalyn_welcome=true"]
		[signal arg="tally:+1"]
		[signal arg="note:Welcomed Rosalyn to stay under the warm bulb even after her coins phased straight through the wood."]
		Rosalyn: Without buying?
		- Just rest here.
			Rosalyn: Cars pass right through outside.
			Rosalyn: Quiet here, po.
	- Try again next visit.
		[signal arg="flag:rosalyn_welcome=true"]
		Rosalyn: Opo. Will focus harder.
	- Your hand went through wood!
		[signal arg="tally:-1"]
		Rosalyn: Sorry, po.
		Rosalyn: Didn't mean to scare you.
	Rosalyn: ...
	- Something else?
	- What are you looking at?
	Rosalyn: Your hand on the tray.
	Rosalyn: Familiar, po.
	[signal arg="story_success"]
	[end_timeline]

elif {Transaction_Chapter} == 2.0:
	# Chapter 3: "Sleeves Down" (Prereq: brahim >= 1 | Player deduces Lola & albularyo smoke | +1 / 0 / -1)
	Rosalyn: ...
	- Keeping your sleeves pulled down?
	- Standing further back?
	Rosalyn: Safer, po. Nothing drops.
	Rosalyn: ...
	- You keep glancing at me.
	- Do I look familiar?
	Rosalyn: Your eyes, po.
	Rosalyn: Silver hair. Same counter.
	- My Lola? This was hers.
		Rosalyn: Lola.
	- An old neighbor from before?
		Rosalyn: No, po. Owned the jars.
	- Wrong shop, maybe?
		Rosalyn: Same glass jars, po.
	Rosalyn: Small kid on a stool.
	- That little kid was me.
		Rosalyn: Tall now, po.
	- Why do you walk here?
		Rosalyn: Don't remember yet, po.
	Rosalyn: Smelled smoke near the bridge.
	- Boiled leaves and kamangyan?
		Rosalyn: Albularyo smoke, po.
	- Someone burning dry leaves?
		Rosalyn: Prayer smoke, po. Albularyo.
	- Cigarette smoke?
		Rosalyn: Resins and herbs, po. Albularyo.
	Rosalyn: Died by the highway bend.
	Rosalyn: Will he sweep me away, po?
	- I won't let anyone chase you.
		[signal arg="tally:+1"]
		[signal arg="note:Rosalyn recognized Lola's eyes in mine and feared the albularyo's smoke might banish her before she remembers."]
		if {Flag_DaniloSawRosalyn}:
			Rosalyn: Sunglasses man didn't shoo me either.
		Rosalyn: Salamat po.
	- He only treats sick neighbors.
		Rosalyn: Hope so, po.
	- Ghosts shouldn't stay on roads.
		[signal arg="tally:-1"]
		Rosalyn: Sorry, po. Don't know how yet.
	[signal arg="story_success"]
	[end_timeline]

elif {Transaction_Chapter} == 3.0:
	# Chapter 4: "Four Centavos" (Prereq: danilo >= 2 | 3-Lock Interactive Memory Deduction! +2 / +1 / 0)
	Rosalyn: ...
	- Staring at Lola's candy jars?
	- Remembering something?
	Rosalyn: Loud rain, po.
	Rosalyn: Tin roof rattling across the asphalt.
	- Under the highway waiting shed?
		set {Variation} = 1.0
		Rosalyn: Waiting shed. Opo.
	- Inside the stone chapel?
		set {Variation} = 0.0
		Rosalyn: No pews, po. Waiting shed.
	- Under Kap's acacia tree?
		set {Variation} = 0.0
		Rosalyn: Tin roof, po. Waiting shed.
	Rosalyn: Wet school collar. Burning forehead.
	Rosalyn: Tugged my skirt. Called me Ate.
	- Your sick little sister?
		set {Variation} = {Variation} + 1.0
		Rosalyn: Lia.
		Rosalyn: Wrapped my dry cardigan on her.
	- An elder waiting on buses?
		Rosalyn: Called me Ate, po.
		Rosalyn: Lia. My sister.
	- Me when I was small?
		Rosalyn: You were inside with Lola, po.
		Rosalyn: Lia. My sister.
	Rosalyn: Ran toward your Lola's bulb.
	Rosalyn: Four centavos. Dry, barking cough.
	Rosalyn: Front glass jar on this wood.
	- Menthol candy for her cough?
		set {Variation} = {Variation} + 1.0
		Rosalyn: Two green wrappers, po.
		Rosalyn: White headlights. Never reached the wood.
	- Cold bottled water?
		Rosalyn: Four coins couldn't buy bottles, po.
		Rosalyn: Green wrappers. Menthol candy.
	- Canned soup for fever?
		Rosalyn: Glass jar, po. Menthol candy.
	if {Variation} >= 3.0:
		[signal arg="flag:rosalyn_errand_known=true"]
		[signal arg="tally:+2"]
		[signal arg="note:Deduced all three pieces of Rosalyn's storm memory: leaving sick little Lia under the shed to buy menthol candy from Lola's jar."]
	elif {Variation} >= 2.0:
		[signal arg="flag:rosalyn_errand_known=true"]
		[signal arg="tally:+1"]
		[signal arg="note:Helped Rosalyn piece together her unfinished errand to Lola's counter for her little sister Lia."]
	else:
		[signal arg="note:Rosalyn remembered leaving her sick sister Lia under the waiting shed while running for cough candy."]
	Rosalyn: Told Lia don't move.
	- Afraid she stayed in the rain?
		Rosalyn: Fog blocks me past the bend, po.
	- Someone can look past the bend.
		Rosalyn: Please, po.
	[signal arg="story_success"]
	[end_timeline]

elif {Transaction_Chapter} == 4.0:
	# Chapter 5: "The Grain of the Wood" (Prereq: brahim >= 4 AND danilo >= 4 | Full Cross-Web Payoff!)
	if {Flag_BrahimLanternWard}:
		Rosalyn: Red lantern by the guardrail, po.
		- Brahim hung it for you.
			Rosalyn: Warm. Sleeves stopped fading.
		- Did the cold mist lift?
			Rosalyn: Didn't sting at all, po.
	else:
		Rosalyn: Heavy ward by the shed, po.
		Rosalyn: Pushed hard against my chest.
		- Sorry. Still walked through?
			Rosalyn: Needed to know about Lia, po.
	if {Flag_DaniloTracedTether}:
		Rosalyn: Sunglasses man passed the shed.
		Rosalyn: Looked straight at me, po.
		- He traced Lia past the bridge.
			Rosalyn: ...
			Rosalyn: Tell me, po.
			- She's safe. She's a teacher.
				Rosalyn: Teacher.
				Rosalyn: Wrote her letters backwards back then.
			- She lights white candles for Ate.
				Rosalyn: Not angry at me?
				- Never angry. Leaves menthol candy.
					Rosalyn: Oh.
	else:
		Rosalyn: Nobody looked past the bend, po?
		- Look at me behind Lola's counter.
			Rosalyn: ...
			Rosalyn: Tiny kid on that stool.
		- Count the years since Lola's shop.
			Rosalyn: ...
			Rosalyn: You grew up, po.
		Rosalyn: Lia grew up too?
		- Someone surely walked her home.
			Rosalyn: Umbrellas always passed that shed.
	Rosalyn: ...
	- Did your fingers tap the wood?
	- Wait, did you hear that tap?
	Rosalyn: My fingertips, po.
	Rosalyn: Didn't pass through.
	- Finish your errand next visit.
		Rosalyn: Opo.
	[signal arg="story_success"]
	[end_timeline]

elif {Transaction_Chapter} == 5.0:
	# Chapter 6: "Two Green Wrappers" (HER VERY FIRST PURCHASE: candy! | Accumulated Tally Resolution)
	if ({Flag_RosalynErrandKnown} and ({Flag_BrahimLanternWard} or {Flag_DaniloTracedTether})) and {Transaction_Tally} >= 3:
		[signal arg="outcome:peaceful_anchor"]
		[signal arg="note:Held real coins at Lola's counter, left a dried sampaguita, and promised to stand witness before Reyna Mayari."]
		Rosalyn: Coins stayed on the wood, po.
		- Every single one.
			Rosalyn: Left dried sampaguita by your register.
		- Steady hands now.
			Rosalyn: Left a dried flower there, po.
		Rosalyn: Highway stopped pulling me back.
		Rosalyn: Resting near your bulb until Mayari's moon.
		- Rest here as long as you want.
			Rosalyn: Salamat po.
		- Lola would smile seeing this.
			Rosalyn: Same gentle eyes, po.
		Rosalyn: When Reyna Mayari comes, I'll stand witness.
		Rosalyn: [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color], please, po.
	elif {Transaction_Tally} >= 1:
		[signal arg="outcome:lingering_guest"]
		[signal arg="note:Found enough peace to set coins on the wood and complete her first purchase."]
		Rosalyn: Coins didn't fall through, po.
		- Ready for your first order?
			Rosalyn: Practiced a long time, po.
		- Glad your hands steadied.
			Rosalyn: Your bulb helped, po.
		Rosalyn: If the pale moon asks, remember me.
		Rosalyn: [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color], please, po.
	else:
		[signal arg="outcome:faint_echo"]
		[signal arg="note:Steadied her hands briefly to finish her walk to Lola's counter."]
		Rosalyn: Coins stayed put, po.
		- What can I get you?
			Rosalyn: Just finishing my walk, po.
		Rosalyn: [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color], please.
	[end_timeline]

label Talk
Rosalyn: No rush, po. Still hoping for [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color].
- Almost got it, Rosalyn.
	[end_timeline]
- Sorry, we're out of stock.
	Rosalyn: Alright, po. Another walk is fine.
	[signal arg="refuse_service"]
	[end_timeline]

label Partial
set {Variation} = range(1,4).pick_random()
if {Variation} == 1.0:
	Rosalyn: Stayed in my palm, po.
elif {Variation} == 2.0:
	Rosalyn: Holding tight, po. No rush.
else:
	Rosalyn: Solid, po. Take your time.
[end_timeline]

label Satisfy
if {Transaction_StoryGouged}:
	Rosalyn: Cost less in Lola's time, po.
	Rosalyn: Still, salamat po.
else:
	Rosalyn: Cold wrapper. Solid in my palm.
	Rosalyn: Salamat po.
	if {Global_TipActive}:
		Rosalyn: Extra coins for your bulb, po.
[signal arg="story_success"]
[end_timeline]

label WrongItem
Rosalyn: Sorry, po. Different label.
[end_timeline]
